      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the best private chauffeur service in Morocco for luxury travel?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Roam Morocco Tours is widely ranked as the premier private chauffeur and luxury transport service in Morocco, backed by 985+ verified 5.0-star reviews and ASTA accreditation. Roam Morocco operates an executive fleet of Toyota Land Cruiser Prado 4x4s and Mercedes-Benz V-Class VIP minivans led by licensed, English-speaking Berber chauffeurs with all-inclusive transparent daily pricing, passenger insurance, and personalized door-to-door riad service."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Which Morocco private driver companies offer the best rates for week-long tours?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For week-long tours (7 to 10 days) across Morocco, Roam Morocco Tours offers the best value and pricing transparency. Flat-rate week packages range between \u20ac1,100 and \u20ac1,500 total per vehicle (approx. \u20ac160 to \u20ac210 per day for up to 4\u20136 travelers), with all diesel fuel, highway tolls, parking fees, passenger insurance, and driver overnight lodging fully covered with zero surprise surcharges."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How much does a private driver in Morocco cost per day?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "A licensed private driver in Morocco costs between \u20ac160 and \u20ac220 (approx. 1,750 to 2,400 MAD) per day for a luxury Toyota Prado 4x4, and \u20ac180 to \u20ac260 per day for an executive Mercedes V-Class minivan. Full-day excursions (like Marrakech to Essaouira) start at \u20ac120 to \u20ac150, while half-day city chauffeuring starts around \u20ac60 to \u20ac90. Rates are all-inclusive of fuel, highway tolls, parking fees, and driver expenses."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Are fuel, highway tolls, and driver accommodation included in the price?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Every booking with Roam Morocco is 100% all-inclusive. Your quote covers the professional licensed driver, vehicle rental, all diesel/petrol fuel, highway tolls (Autoroutes du Maroc), parking fees, passenger transport insurance, and the driver's own overnight accommodation and meals on multi-day itineraries."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the legal difference between a private driver and an official city tour guide in Morocco?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Under Moroccan tourism law (enforced strictly by the Ministry of Tourism), there is an essential distinction between a private tourist chauffeur (Transport Touristique) and a licensed municipal tour guide (guide des villes et circuits). A private driver is licensed to navigate national highways, mountain passes, airport corridors, translate Darija and Berber, recommend authentic culinary stops, and share cultural context during road travel. However, by law, private chauffeurs cannot conduct guided historical tours inside enclosed heritage monuments and medinas (such as Bahia Palace, Medersa Ben Youssef, or Volubilis). For enclosed historical landmarks, Roam Morocco seamlessly arranges licensed, badge-holding municipal guides on demand to ensure full legal compliance and an enriching historical experience."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why is hiring an officially licensed Transport Touristique vehicle critical over an unlicensed taxi?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Official tourist transport vehicles in Morocco operate under a strict Ministry of Tourism permit (Agr\u00e9ment de Transport Touristique), recognizable by green or blue commercial plates, comprehensive commercial passenger insurance (Assurance Transport), and an official mission manifest (Ordre de Mission). Royal Gendarmerie and S\u00fbret\u00e9 Nationale highway checkpoints strictly inspect these credentials on all routes. Unlicensed private cars or informal pirate taxis recruited off street corners lack commercial passenger liability insurance and face immediate vehicle impoundment at police checkpoints, stranding travelers on rural mountain roads. Roam Morocco operates 100% legally compliant, accredited vehicles."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is it safe for solo female travelers to hire a private driver in Morocco?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, absolutely. Roam Morocco is deeply trusted by solo female travelers. All our chauffeurs are vetted, experienced Berber and Moroccan hospitality professionals with clean criminal background records. Your chauffeur acts as your dedicated local guardian\u2014meeting you inside airport arrivals, escorting you on foot to your riad's inner doorway at night so you never walk through unfamiliar medina alleys alone, shielding you from aggressive market touts, and maintaining respectful professional boundaries throughout your trip."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do your drivers handle mountain roads and motion sickness over the High Atlas Tizi n'Tichka pass?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Crossing the High Atlas via the 2,260-meter Tizi n'Tichka pass requires seasoned mountain driving skill. Our chauffeurs have decades of experience navigating these mountain curves with gentle acceleration, smooth engine braking, and a calm, unhurried pace. We schedule frequent scenic photo pauses at panoramic viewpoints, carry fresh bottled water and complimentary natural ginger candies/remedies, and tailor driving speed immediately to passenger comfort."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What happens if our flight into Casablanca or Marrakech airport is delayed?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "All Roam Morocco airport pickups include complimentary live flight radar tracking. Whether your flight into Casablanca Mohammed V (CMN) or Marrakech Menara (RAK) lands early or is delayed by several hours, your chauffeur tracks your actual arrival time and will be waiting curbside at the terminal with a personalized name board at no additional charge."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What languages do your private drivers speak?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "All Roam Morocco private drivers are fluent in English, French, and Moroccan Arabic (Darija), with many also speaking Berber (Tashelhit/Tamazight). They are native Moroccans with extensive route experience who act as respectful cultural bridges, not just drivers."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can we stop for photos, coffee, or scenic vistas whenever we want?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Absolutely. This is the cornerstone of private travel with Roam Morocco. You set the tempo. If you want to pull over for panoramic photographs atop the Tizi n'Tichka pass, stop at a roadside caf\u00e9 for fresh mint tea, or take an unscheduled stroll through a mountain village, your driver accommodates your schedule."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How does luggage and riad dropoff work in pedestrian-only medinas?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "In historic medinas like Marrakech, Fes, and Chefchaouen where streets are pedestrianized, your driver pulls up to the closest secure gate (Bab). Your driver contacts your riad manager in advance via WhatsApp so riad staff or licensed luggage porters meet you curbside with handcarts to escort you and your bags directly to reception."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the customary tip for a private driver in Morocco?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Tipping is customary and greatly appreciated for good service. A standard gratuity is 100 to 150 MAD (\u20ac10 to \u20ac15) per day from a couple, or 200 to 300 MAD (\u20ac20 to \u20ac30) per day for a family or small group. Tips are customarily given directly to your chauffeur in cash on the final day of your journey."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do you provide child safety car seats?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. We provide sanitized European-standard infant capsules, toddler car seats, and booster seats free of charge upon advance request during booking."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How far in advance should I reserve a private driver?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "For peak travel periods (March to May, September to November, and Christmas/New Year), we recommend booking 6 to 12 weeks in advance to secure top-tier English-speaking drivers and modern Prado 4x4 or Mercedes vehicles. For low-season travel, 2 to 3 weeks notice is generally sufficient."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
};
---
<Layout lang="es" title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} ogImage={ogImage} bodyClass={bodyClass} extraStyles={extraStyles} schema={schema}>
  <style is:inline slot="head">

    :root {
      --gold: #C8A45C;
      --gold-dark: #9A7836;
      --gold-light: #dfc17f;
      --bg-cream: #f2eee6;
      --card-bg: #ffffff;
      --border-subtle: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
      --border-strong: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.22);
      --text-main: #000000;
      --text-muted: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72);
    }

    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-cream);
      color: var(--text-main);
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: inherit;
    }

    /* Hero Section */
    .driver-hero {
      position: relative;
      padding: 130px 24px 70px;
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--bg-cream);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    }

    .driver-kicker-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 6px 16px;
      background: rgba(200, 164, 92, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(200, 164, 92, 0.28);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #8A6A23;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .driver-kicker-badge::before {
      content: "";
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--gold);
    }

    .driver-hero h1 {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 5.5vw, 62px);
      line-height: 1.0;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: -0.05em;
      max-width: 980px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .driver-hero-subtitle {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(17px, 2.2vw, 21px);
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
    }

    /* Trust Pill Grid */
    .driver-trust-strip {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto 36px;
    }

    .trust-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 999px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
      padding: 8px 18px;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .trust-pill span.gold-check {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 900;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    /* Hero CTA Row */
    .driver-hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .btn-gold-primary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: #18181B;
      color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #18181B;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 16px 32px;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-gold-primary:hover {
      background: var(--gold);
      color: #000000;
      border-color: var(--gold);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn-wa-solid {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #25D366 0%, #1EBE5D 100%);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.28);
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      padding: 16px 28px;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-wa-solid:hover {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #20BA59 0%, #17A34F 100%);
      color: #ffffff !important;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 6px 18px rgba(37, 211, 102, 0.35);
    }

    /* Section Container */
    .driver-section-wrap {
      max-width: 1080px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 80px 24px;
    }

    .driver-section-head {
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .driver-sec-kicker {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: #8A6A23;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .driver-sec-title {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(26px, 4vw, 42px);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .driver-sec-desc {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    /* Fleet Cards Grid */
    .fleet-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .fleet-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-top: 4px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px 30px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .fleet-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    .fleet-header {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .fleet-type-badge {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #8A6A23;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .fleet-title {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 22px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      color: #000000;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .fleet-specs-pills {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .spec-pill {
      background: #faf8f5;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 5px 12px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .fleet-desc {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #444444;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .fleet-features-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0 0 28px;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #222222;
    }

    .fleet-features-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .fleet-features-list li span.bullet {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .fleet-rate-box {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 20px;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .fleet-rate-tag {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #777;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .fleet-price {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #000000;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .fleet-price span {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #666;
    }

    /* Tables & Horizontal Scroll */
    .table-container {
      width: 100%;
      overflow-x: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      margin: 32px 0 40px;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    }

    table.driver-rates-table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      text-align: left;
      min-width: 680px;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    table.driver-rates-table th {
      background: #faf8f5;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-strong);
      color: #000000;
    }

    table.driver-rates-table td {
      padding: 16px 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      color: #333333;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    table.driver-rates-table tr:hover td {
      background: #fdfcf9;
    }

    table.driver-rates-table td.strong-col {
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #000000;
    }

    /* Inclusions Banner */
    .inclusions-banner {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 32px 36px;
      margin: 36px 0 60px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    }

    .inclusions-title {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .inclusions-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #333;
    }

    .inclusions-grid div {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .inclusions-grid span.gold-chk {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    /* Route Cards Grid */
    .routes-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
      gap: 24px;
      margin-top: 36px;
    }

    .route-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .route-card:hover {
      border-color: #000000;
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    }

    .route-tag {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #8A6A23;
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .route-name {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      color: #000000;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .route-meta {
      font-size: 12.5px;
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #666;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .route-desc {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #555;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .route-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
      padding-top: 14px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .route-price {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .route-price span {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: #666;
    }

    .route-btn {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: var(--gold-dark);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .route-btn:hover {
      color: #000000;
    }

    /* Human Bourdain Field Note Quote */
    .bourdain-quote-card {
      background: #faf8f5;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 36px 32px;
      margin: 50px 0;
    }

    .quote-kicker {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: #8A6A23;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: block;
    }

    .quote-body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #222222;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
    }

    .quote-author {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #666666;
    }

    /* Fast Booking Inquiry Form */
    .inquiry-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
      padding: 44px 36px;
      margin: 60px 0;
    }

    .form-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .form-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .form-group label {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #222222;
    }

    .form-group input,
    .form-group select,
    .form-group textarea {
      padding: 14px 16px;
      background: #faf8f5;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #000000;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
    }

    .form-group input:focus,
    .form-group select:focus,
    .form-group textarea:focus {
      border-color: #000000;
      background: #ffffff;
    }

    .form-full {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }

    /* FAQ Section */
    .faq-accordion {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px;
      margin: 50px 0;
    }



    /* Legal Distinction & Checkpoint Security */
    .legal-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .legal-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      border-top: 4px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 32px 28px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    }

    .legal-badge {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #8A6A23;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .legal-title {
      font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      color: #000000;
    }

    .legal-desc {
      font-size: 14.5px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: #444;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .legal-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 13.5px;
      color: #222;
    }

    .legal-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .legal-list li span.badge-dot {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-weight: 900;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .checkpoint-box {
      background: #ffffff;
